code: 0
--- stdout
Take the issue into the current sprint

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Sprint:    sets Sprint to today's iteration (dates in UTC); none for today is an error, see gh dojo doctor

Usage:
  gh dojo plan <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for plan
--- stderr
